Package: flippies-video
Version: 1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Create Flippies <flippies@deb.flip>
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-tk, gstreamer1.0-tools, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base
Description: Small video player for the Create Flippies desktop
 Plays a video file in a window on the 256-colour display: GStreamer decodes it
 (Ogg Theora with the base plugins) and scales it down, and Tk shows the frames.
 GStreamer's own X output cannot draw on an 8-bit display. No sound: the PC has
 no sound card.
